  47:     - Recolor every exterior background pixel that 8-touches the foreground to green.
  48: 
  49:     Key insight:
  50:     - The two new colors separate background by region: unreachable-from-border background is hole fill, while border-reachable background adjacent to the foreground is the outside outline.
  51:     """
